Algorithm references (no code reproduced)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`cispo_minimax` implements the CISPO objective of MiniMax-M1
(https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.13585, Eq. 4-5). It was written against the published
equations and the SLIME implementation (`slime/utils/ppo_utils.py`,
`compute_cispo_loss`, Apache-2.0) as a semantic reference. No SLIME source is
reproduced here. SLIME's input convention is `ppo_kl = old - new`, so its
`ratio = exp(-ppo_kl)`; this package computes `ratio = exp(current - behavior)`
directly, which is the same quantity.

`prem-research/mlx-tinker` carries no license and no license metadata. No portion
of it is reproduced, adapted, or derived from in this package. Its `cispo_loss`
is additionally a two-sided, advantage-sign-selected variant and is not a
reference for `cispo_minimax`.
